    <profile name="Blessings of Sheaala" typeId="c1ac-c1c8-f9d5-9673" typeName="Special Rule" hidden="false" id="85be-f3d4-94c8-c3e0">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9f84-4221-785a-db50">Even if engaged in combat, this model can cast the following Bound Spell, with a Power Level of 2:


Type: Enchantment
Casting Value: 8+
Range: Self



Effect: Until your next Start of Turn sub-phase, this model and every friendly Ritesinger, Bloodclaw Sisters unit, or Servants of the Serpents unit that is within its Command range gains one of the following:
• Breath of Sheaala (Poisoned Attacks have an additional Armor Penetration (-1))
• Hugh of the Soft Sleep (Poisoned Attacks ignore Regeneration attempts)
• Venom of Purification (a 5+ Regeneration save against any wounds suffered)</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Feral Hunger" typeId="c1ac-c1c8-f9d5-9673" typeName="Special Rule" hidden="false" id="d2c6-bfbe-9b0e-7ce8">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9f84-4221-785a-db50">Whenever this model follows or charges any unit, it gains +1 modifier to the dice throw and +1 Attack during the next phase of combat.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
